    "title": "Falling Path Minimum Sum",
    "category": "Dynamic Programming",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an N \u00d7 N matrix, determine the minimum sum of any falling path. A falling path starts at any element in the first row and moves to the directly below, diagonally left, or diagonally right cell in the next row.",
